#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:36
msgid "Green Claims Phrase Check"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: number of variations checked, 2: number of variations the product has
#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:57
#, php-format
msgid "Only the first %1$d of %2$d variations were checked."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:63
msgid "None of the checked phrases found. This check looks for a short list of phrases only and does not assess other environmental claims."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:69
msgid "Phrases to review:"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:78
msgid "A match is not a breach in itself. Point 4a does not apply when you can show recognised excellent environmental performance relevant to the claim, or when the claim is specified in clear and prominent terms on the same medium, such as the online selling interface (recital 9 of Directive (EU) 2024/825). Point 4c covers climate claims based on offsetting."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:87
msgid "EU Legal Guarantee & Durability (Article 6(1)(l) and (la) of Directive 2011/83/EU)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:91
msgid "Hide guarantee reminder"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:92
msgid "Hide the goods legal guarantee reminder on this product, for example a digital download or a service. Article 6(1)(lb) of Directive 2011/83/EU requires a separate reminder for digital content and digital services, which Garantio does not show."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:97
msgid "Commercial Durability (Years)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:98
msgid "Only if the producer offers a commercial guarantee of durability at no extra cost for more than 2 years (e.g. 3, 5, 10). Values of 2 or less are not saved."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:106
msgid "Producer / Brand Name"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:107
msgid "Name of the manufacturer offering the commercial durability guarantee."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:113
msgid "Repairability Class (A - E)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:114
msgid "Repairability class from the energy label of a smartphone or slate tablet under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/1669, from 20 June 2025. Article 1 excludes phones and tablets with a main display the user can roll up or unroll, and smartphones for high security communication. Leave it empty for every other product. Garantio shows the class as a badge, not in the official label format."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ProductMetaBox.php:117
msgid "None"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:29
msgid "Garantio EU Guarantees"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:30
msgid "EU Legal Guarantee"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:72
msgid "Garantio - EU Legal Guarantee & Durability Notices"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:74
msgid "Legal guarantee reminder (Article 6(1)(l) of Directive 2011/83/EU), durability guarantee note (Article 6(1)(la)) and a green claims phrase check (Annex I, points 4a and 4c, of Directive 2005/29/EC). The reminder is plain text, not the harmonised notice of Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1960, which applies from 27 September 2026 and which this plugin does not display."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:81
msgid "Enable legal guarantee reminder"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:85
